---
import MakerLayout from '../layouts/MakerLayout.astro';
import demand from '../data/demand.json';
import seoOpportunities from '../data/seo-opportunities.json';
const tools=[['01','Bingo Card Generator','Build custom 5×5 bingo cards from your own prompts, names or vocabulary.','/bingo-card-generator/'],['02','Word Search Generator','Turn a word list into a printable puzzle in seconds.','/word-search-generator/'],['03','Random Team Generator','Split a list into random groups without an account.','/random-team-generator/'],['04','Decision Wheel','Put choices in and get one random answer out.','/decision-wheel/'],['05','Tournament Bracket','Create first-round knockout matchups for teams or players.','/tournament-bracket-generator/'],['06','Raffle Ticket Generator','Make numbered printable tickets for events and fundraisers.','/raffle-ticket-generator/'],['07','Seating Chart Generator','Turn a name list into a clean randomized seating chart.','/seating-chart-generator/'],['08','Certificate Maker','Create a clean certificate for appreciation or recognition.','/certificate-maker/']];
const trending=demand.opportunities.slice(0,4);
const globalTrends=demand.globalTrends?.slice(0,8) || [];
---
<MakerLayout title="PARADOX Makers — Free Generators" description="Free browser-first generators for bingo cards, word searches, random teams, decision wheels, tournament brackets, raffle tickets, seating charts and certificates. No account required.">
<main class="maker-main">
<section class="maker-hero"><div><div class="maker-kicker">FREE TOOLS · NO ACCOUNT</div><h1>Find the tool.<br/><em>Finish the job.</em></h1><p>Small utilities for classrooms, parties, teams, events and everyday life. Enter your content, generate the result, then print or save it.</p><div class="maker-actions"><a class="maker-primary" href="#tools">Browse all tools ↓</a><a class="maker-secondary" href="/trending/">Global demand radar ↗</a></div></div><div class="maker-proof"><div class="proof-tile"><strong>01 · No account</strong><span>Open a tool and start immediately.</span></div><div class="proof-tile"><strong>02 · Browser-first</strong><span>Core generators run in this browser tab.</span></div><div class="proof-tile"><strong>03 · Demand-aware</strong><span>Public trend signals refresh the discovery layer.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="maker-section maker-trend-section"><div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">GLOBAL SEARCH SIGNALS</div><h2>What is moving<br/><em>across markets.</em></h2></div><p>PARADOX samples aggregate public trend signals from multiple countries and public data sources. We use them to surface useful tools, not to expose private search histories.</p></div><div class="maker-trend-grid">{globalTrends.map((item,index)=><a class="maker-trend" href="/trending/"><span>0{index+1}</span><div><strong>{item.query}</strong><small>{item.geo} · {item.traffic || 'trend signal'} →</small></div></a>)}</div><p class="maker-trend-note">Trend refresh: {demand.refreshedAt} · {demand.sourceHealth?.googleTrends?.rows || 0} public trend rows collected.</p></section>
<section class="maker-section maker-trend-section"><div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">TOOLS WITH THE STRONGEST FIT</div><h2>Turn attention<br/><em>into something useful.</em></h2></div><p>These rankings combine trend matches with public media attention. The underlying tools stay the same and remain free to use.</p></div><div class="maker-trend-grid">{trending.map((item,index)=><a class="maker-trend" href={item.route}><span>0{index+1}</span><div><strong>{item.label}</strong><small>Signal score {item.score} · use the {item.mode} tool →</small></div></a>)}</div><p class="maker-trend-note"><a href="/use-cases/">Browse demand-driven use cases →</a></p></section>
<section class="maker-section" id="tools"><div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">ALL TOOLS</div><h2>Choose the thing<br/>you need.</h2></div><p>No dashboard. No setup maze. Each page focuses on one job and explains exactly what to enter.</p></div><div class="maker-tools">{tools.map(([number,name,desc,href])=><a class="maker-card" href={href}><div><div class="maker-card-top"><div class="maker-icon">{number}</div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h2>{name}</h2><p>{desc}</p></div><div class="maker-open">Open tool →</div></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="maker-section" id="guides"><div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">GUIDES</div><h2>Get it right<br/>the first time.</h2></div><p>Short practical guides for making better puzzles, teams and printables.</p></div><div class="maker-guide-grid"><a class="maker-guide" href="/guides/bingo-cards/">How to make a better bingo card →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/guides/word-searches/">How to build a readable word search →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/guides/random-teams/">How to split a group fairly →</a><a class="maker-guide" href="/guides/printables/">How to print browser-made worksheets cleanly →</a></div></section>
<section class="maker-section"><div class="maker-section-head"><div><div class="maker-label">DEMAND-DRIVEN PAGES</div><h2>Useful landing pages<br/><em>when the signal earns one.</em></h2></div><p>The system can publish a small number of topic-specific pages when a current public trend maps cleanly to a working generator.</p></div><div class="maker-guide-grid">{seoOpportunities.slice(0,6).map(item=><a class="maker-guide" href={`/use-cases/${item.slug}/`}><strong>{item.title}</strong><br/>{item.description}</a>)}</div></section>
<section class="maker-section" id="why"><article class="maker-why"><div class="maker-label">WHY IT'S FREE</div><h1>Useful first.<br/>Friction last.</h1><p>PARADOX Makers is designed around quick, focused jobs. There is no account wall for the core generators and no requirement to upload your source material.</p><p>We keep the tools free and support the public site with clearly separated advertising.</p></article></section>
</main>
</MakerLayout>
